/-!
# Uniform attachment with freezing

Entry point for the formalization of `attachement-uniforme-1-final.tex`.
The three universal height limits are exposed through `MainHeight` and
`MainMaximum`, for the actual forward random-tree law. The linear-regime height
scale, uniform-vertex height and pair distance are proved in
`MainLinearHeightScale`, `MainLinearUniformHeight` and `MainLinearDistance`;
its maximum upper tail is in `LinearMaximumUpper`.
Deterministic supporting results are exposed through `PaperResults`.
See `FORMALIZATION_REPORT.md` for the complete source inventory, proof evidence,
source corrections, and the remaining main results.
-/
